<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<form:Form xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:core="http://g5.1c.ru/v8/dt/mcore" xmlns:form="http://g5.1c.ru/v8/dt/form">
  <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
    <name>UsePushNotifications</name>
    <id>1</id>
    <title>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Push notifications</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>اعلان‌های پوش</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Notifiche Push</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Powiadomienia Push</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Push-уведомления</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Anlık bildirim</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Thông báo đẩy</value>
    </title>
    <visible>true</visible>
    <enabled>true</enabled>
    <userVisible>
      <common>true</common>
    </userVisible>
    <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
      <segments>Object.PushNotificationOption</segments>
    </dataPath>
    <toolTipRepresentation>ShowBottom</toolTipRepresentation>
    <handlers>
      <event>OnChange</event>
      <name>UsePushNotificationsOnChange</name>
    </handlers>
    <extendedTooltip>
      <name>UsePushNotificationsExtendedTooltip</name>
      <id>3</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>&lt;fontsize 8>1C Company developed a special supporting service (&lt;/>&lt;fontsize 8>&lt;link http://pushnotifications.1c.com>http://pushnotifications.1c.com&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;fontsize 8>) for sending notifications. The service allows you to send notifications from off-the-shelf applications. Just register your infobase as a notification sender.&lt;/></value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>&lt;fontsize 8>شرکت 1C یک سرویس پشتیبان ویژه (&lt;/>&lt;fontsize 8>&lt;link http://pushnotifications.1c.com>http://pushnotifications.1c.com&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;fontsize 8>) برای ارسال اعلان‌ها توسعه داده است. این سرویس امکان ارسال اعلان‌ها از برنامه‌های آماده را فراهم می‌کند. کافی است پایگاه اطلاعات خود را به‌عنوان فرستنده اعلان ثبت کنید.&lt;/></value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>&lt;fontsize 8>Фирмой «1С» разработан специальный вспомогательный сервис (&lt;/>&lt;fontsize 8>&lt;link http://pushnotifications.1c.com>http://pushnotifications.1c.com&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;fontsize 8>) для отправки уведомлений. Этот сервис предназначен для облегчения реализации отправки уведомлений из тиражных прикладных решений. Просто зарегистрируйте свою базу данных, как отправителя уведомлений.&lt;/></value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>&lt;fontsize 8>&quot;1C&quot; firması, bildirim göndermek için özel bir yardımcı servis (&lt;/>&lt;fontsize 8>&lt;link http://pushnotifications.1c.com>http://pushnotifications.1c.com&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;fontsize 8>) geliştirmiştir. Bu servis, dolaşımdaki uygulama çözümlerinden bildirim gönderimini kolaylaştırmak amacıyla tasarlanmıştır. Bildirim göndericisi olarak veritabanınızı kaydetmeniz yeterlidir.&lt;/></value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>&lt;fontsize 8>Công ty «1С» đã phát triển dịch vụ bổ trợ đặc biệt (&lt;/>&lt;fontsize 8>&lt;link http://pushnotifications.1c.com>http://pushnotifications.1c.com&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;fontsize 8>) để gửi thông báo. Dịch vụ này được dùng để dễ dàng gửi thông báo từ các giải pháp ứng dụng mẫu. Chỉ cần đăng ký cơ sở dữ liệu của bạn như là nơi gửi thông báo.&lt;/></value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>&lt;fontsize 8>1C Company developed a special supporting service (&lt;/>&lt;fontsize 8>&lt;link http://pushnotifications.1c.com>http://pushnotifications.1c.com&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;fontsize 8>) for sending notifications. The service allows you to send notifications from off-the-shelf applications. Just register your infobase as a notification sender.&lt;/></value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>&lt;fontsize 8>1C Company developed a special supporting service (&lt;/>&lt;fontsize 8>&lt;link http://pushnotifications.1c.com>http://pushnotifications.1c.com&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;fontsize 8>) for sending notifications. The service allows you to send notifications from off-the-shelf applications. Just register your infobase as a notification sender.&lt;/></value>
      </title>
      <formatted>true</formatted>
      <type>Label</type>
      <height>2</height>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
        <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
        <verticalAlign>Top</verticalAlign>
      </extInfo>
    </extendedTooltip>
    <contextMenu>
      <name>UsePushNotificationsContextMenu</name>
      <id>2</id>
      <autoFill>true</autoFill>
    </contextMenu>
    <type>RadioButtonField</type>
    <editMode>Enter</editMode>
    <showInHeader>true</showInHeader>
    <headerHorizontalAlign>Left</headerHorizontalAlign>
    <showInFooter>true</showInFooter>
    <extInfo xsi:type="form:RadioButtonsFieldExtInfo">
      <columnsCount>1</columnsCount>
      <choiceList>
        <presentation>
          <key>en</key>
          <value>Do not send</value>
        </presentation>
        <presentation>
          <key>fa</key>
          <value>ارسال نشود</value>
        </presentation>
        <presentation>
          <key>it</key>
          <value>Non inviare</value>
        </presentation>
        <presentation>
          <key>pl</key>
          <value>Nie wysyłaj</value>
        </presentation>
        <presentation>
          <key>ru</key>
          <value>Не отправлять</value>
        </presentation>
        <presentation>
          <key>tr</key>
          <value>Gönderme</value>
        </presentation>
        <presentation>
          <key>vi</key>
          <value>Không gửi</value>
        </presentation>
        <value xsi:type="core:ReferenceValue">
          <value>Enum.PushNotificationOptions.EnumValue.DontSend</value>
        </value>
      </choiceList>
      <choiceList>
        <presentation>
          <key>en</key>
          <value>Send via 1C:Notification center service</value>
        </presentation>
        <presentation>
          <key>fa</key>
          <value>ارسال از طریق سرویس 1C:Notification center</value>
        </presentation>
        <presentation>
          <key>it</key>
          <value>Invia utilizzando il servizio &quot;1C:Centro notifiche&quot;</value>
        </presentation>
        <presentation>
          <key>pl</key>
          <value>Wyślij, używając serwis &quot;1С:Centrum powiadomień&quot;</value>
        </presentation>
        <presentation>
          <key>ru</key>
          <value>Отправлять, используя сервис &quot;1С:Центр уведомлений&quot;</value>
        </presentation>
        <presentation>
          <key>tr</key>
          <value>&quot;1C:Bildirim Merkezi&quot; servisini kullanarak gönder</value>
        </presentation>
        <presentation>
          <key>vi</key>
          <value>Gửi bằng cách sử dụng Service &quot;1C:Trung tâm thông báo&quot;</value>
        </presentation>
        <value xsi:type="core:ReferenceValue">
          <value>Enum.PushNotificationOptions.EnumValue.SendViaSupportingService</value>
        </value>
      </choiceList>
    </extInfo>
  </items>
